<title>USA: Phelps Dodge board OKs six mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Phelps Dodge board OKs six mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phelps Dodge Corp said its board has authorized the repurchase of up to an additional six million of its common shares, about 10 percent of its currently outstanding shares.</p>
<p>This authorization follows a five million share repurchase program that was initiated in 1995 and extended to 10 million shares in 1996.  Under that program, 9.9 million shares were repurchased by the company.</p>
